{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/8882f813de8813bde7eb3a9eacc7b72c.avif?t=1760531113\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction Crew</strong> throws you straight onto the job site, where every shovel of dirt and every stripe of paint takes you closer to a finished road. <strong>Team up with friends or go solo</strong>, climb into massive machines, and turn an empty patch of ground into brand-new pavement. From the roar of excavators to the rumble of road rollers, the whole build is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.poster.avif?t=1760531113\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.webm?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.mp4?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features a complete road-building contract in a small town. Start by fencing off the site and unloading your gear, then dig, grade, compact, lay materials, pave, roll, stripe, and clean up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you see the road stretch out in front of you when the dust settles, you'll feel a unique sense of pride and accomplishment, knowing every detail reflects your hard work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.poster.avif?t=1760531113\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.webm?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.mp4?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's the meticulous stripes you painted or the smooth surface you paved, each piece of the project is a testament to your skill and teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel empowered as you turn a simple stretch of land into something new and useful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on construction</strong> \u2013 Take on contracts that cover the full job cycle: excavation, grading, paving, rolling, painting, and cleanup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate 7 different machines\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Excavator, Bulldozer, Truck, Ground Roller, Road Roller, Asphalt Paver, Road marker vehicle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op up to 4 players</strong> \u2013 Build faster and better together. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic worksites</strong> \u2013 terrain deforms, materials spread, and every roller pass changes the look and feel of the ground.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586780?t=1760531113","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/6e1574674d9fd67814b142aad088f0279c86e0f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760531113","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/7c3d37e9e76e77432f4a19ed127c679059cd1e6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760531113","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/7c3d37e9e76e77432f4a19ed127c679059cd1e6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760531113","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/8882f813de8813bde7eb3a9eacc7b72c.avif?t=1760531113\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construction Crew</strong> throws you straight onto the job site, where every shovel of dirt and every stripe of paint takes you closer to a finished road. <strong>Team up with friends or go solo</strong>, climb into massive machines, and turn an empty patch of ground into brand-new pavement. From the roar of excavators to the rumble of road rollers, the whole build is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.poster.avif?t=1760531113\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.webm?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/37c6a7304f953339c9d92461940c463e.mp4?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features a complete road-building contract in a small town. Start by fencing off the site and unloading your gear, then dig, grade, compact, lay materials, pave, roll, stripe, and clean up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you see the road stretch out in front of you when the dust settles, you'll feel a unique sense of pride and accomplishment, knowing every detail reflects your hard work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.poster.avif?t=1760531113\" width=1170 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.webm?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/extras/0c8d095143a540df14deaf699dd55ef0.mp4?t=1760531113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it's the meticulous stripes you painted or the smooth surface you paved, each piece of the project is a testament to your skill and teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel empowered as you turn a simple stretch of land into something new and useful.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hands-on construction</strong> \u2013 Take on contracts that cover the full job cycle: excavation, grading, paving, rolling, painting, and cleanup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Operate 7 different machines\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Excavator, Bulldozer, Truck, Ground Roller, Road Roller, Asphalt Paver, Road marker vehicle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op up to 4 players</strong> \u2013 Build faster and better together. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic worksites</strong> \u2013 terrain deforms, materials spread, and every roller pass changes the look and feel of the ground.</p></li></ul>","developers":[" Ultimate Games S.A."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3586760","name":"Construction Crew"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586780/b12131c10cbad0a338dba3e4c5eba8f962922566/header.jpg?t=1760531113","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586780/4273874/ed9c4c1fc358b89275b7ac2c22e55cbe61779454/1760006365/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760525593","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586780/4273874/ed9c4c1fc358b89275b7ac2c22e55cbe61779454/1760006365/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760525593","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3586780/4273874/ed9c4c1fc358b89275b7ac2c22e55cbe61779454/1760006365/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760525593","id":257208624,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208624/movie480.mp4?t=1760525593","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208624/movie_max.mp4?t=1760525593"},"name":"Construction Crew - Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208624/07a75c1a349e66ace13512f3eea05b48d7c1c7a8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760525593","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208624/movie480.webm?t=1760525593","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208624/movie_max.web